OL,1,Wppp0ppp0ppp0 pppppppppppppppppppppG5/17
OL,2,W5h 55h 55hp5S||,||h|<,|4||   ||h|<,,$
OL,3,W5h"55h"55j/5S jwss1zubss{5
OL,4,W-,,%-,,%-,,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,$
OL,6, Rhodesia's raid on the home of Mr
OL,7, Joshua Nkomo in Lusaka, Zambia has been
OL,8, criticised by the Foreign Office in
OL,9, London.
OL,11,FA spokesman said they were deeply
OL,12,Fdisturbed by the attack.
OL,14,F"The decision by the Rhodesian
OL,15,Fauthorities to attack Mr Nkomo
OL,16,Fpersonally is a major and deplorable
OL,17,Fstep in the escalation of the war and
OL,18,Fcan only impede the chances of a
OL,19,Fnegotiated settlement."
OL,23,C  FromG13-04-79C/ teletextarchive.com
