OL,4,W-,,%-,,%-,,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,$
OL,6, The US government has ordered the
OL,7, expulsion of two defence attaches in
OL,8, the South African military mission in
OL,9, Washington.
OL,11,BMr Hodding Carter, a State Department
OL,12,Bspokesman, said the action was in
OL,13,Bretaliation for South Africa's decision
OL,14,Bto expel three US embassy staff in
OL,15,BPretoria after allegations of spying.
OL,17,BThe State Department has denied charges
OL,18,Bthat a camera was fitted to an embassy
OL,19,Baircraft and used to photograph secret
OL,20,Binstallatons in South Africa. It has
OL,21,Balso refused to offer an apology: "We
OL,22,Bdo not feel we have any reason to offer
OL,23,Bone," Mr Carter said.    CFromG13-04-79
