OL,6, A part-time member of the Ulster
OL,7, Defence Regiment has been found shot
OL,8, dead in a van near the town of Tynan,
OL,9, in County Armagh.
OL,11,FLocal people heard shots early this
OL,12,Fmorning and later found the man
OL,13,Fslumped over the steering wheel.
OL,15,FHe was Thomas John Armstrong, 63,
OL,16,Fwho was to have left the regiment on
OL,17,FWednesday after serving in it since
OL,18,Fits formation nine years ago.
OL,23,C  FromG13-04-79C/ teletextarchive.com
