OL,4,W-,,%-,,%-,,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,$
OL,6, Leaders of the National Union of
OL,7, Teachers are to recommend members to
OL,8, "withdraw goodwill" because they say
OL,9, there have not been proper negotiations
OL,10, on their pay claim.
OL,12,FMeasures to be proposed to the union's
OL,13,Fconference opening at Scarborough
OL,14,Ftomorrow include refusal to supervise
OL,15,Fchildren at lunchtime, withdrawal from
OL,16,Fvoluntary out-of-school activities, and
OL,17,Frefusal to use personal cars on
OL,18,Fofficial buseness.
OL,19,F
OL,20,FOn Monday, the National Association of
OL,21,FSchoolmasters is expected to recommend
OL,22,Fmalitant action to its conference at
OL,23,FEastbourne.              CFromG13-04-79
